+# json-diff.js comparator is replaced by a semantic-equivalent python
+# implementation shipped alongside (json_diff_ohos.py).
+# Also: the OHOS sandbox denies open(2) on symlinks for packaged binaries,
+# so a symlinked .sofa input is resolved to its real target first.
+
